        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit-Back and Relax while your party of 4 is on the Attack!<br> A Semi-Idle RPG that focuses on class customization and build variety.<br> Thousands of build options at your disposal to take on the challenges you will face!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All with ZERO MTX!!!!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features 60 different classes, 500+ different skills, unlimited amount of build options to help make the team of 4 heroes you control defeat over 300 monsters, bosses, and ultra bosses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun and fast combat with unique challenges and strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increased speed can be unlocked up to 20x!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OFFLINE rewards are included!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every Limit Break you achieve, unlock another Prestige level.<br> Prestige gives your character more manual click power (damage and healing) and gives you timed premium currency to buy loot boxes and other premium goods. <strong>Become a &quot;Whale&quot; (FOR FREE)!</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character &amp; Class Customization</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very in-depth interface that allows you to see every facet of battle, stats, and more to help you decide how to make your team even stronger!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All classes have unique character art and their own skills, strengths, and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leveling up offers stat points that you can use to build a character ANY way you'd like!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of passive skills that can vastly change abilities and playstyles!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pets &amp; Achievements</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose from 1 of 4 pets to help bolster your team and you control when it uses it's special attack. It's base stats also enhance the party!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ Achievements. Each Achievement you earn, raises the level of your pets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet level is global. If you start a new game, it will inherit that level!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet skill can be used manually. It can also be improved by Passive skills on characters!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Leveling &amp; Progression</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new tier of character power (Level 100, 200, 300, up to 500...) must be unlocked by completing challenging maps with Ultra Bosses!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting &amp; Alchemy &amp; Equipment</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft with 16 different ingredients in 4 different crafting slots. 1,024 different trait combinations per piece of equipment!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique equipment has special stats not found in crafting equipment for even more possibilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alchemy craft that allows you to use potions on your allies and enemies manually! This craft can be improved with a characters skills and gear.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ZERO MTX! We play games, but not with your wallet! We ain't shady like that. One-time buy and complete everything in the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Code: MBX92BP</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit-Back and Relax while your party of 4 is on the Attack!<br> A Semi-Idle RPG that focuses on class customization and build variety.<br> Thousands of build options at your disposal to take on the challenges you will face!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All with ZERO MTX!!!!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features 60 different classes, 500+ different skills, unlimited amount of build options to help make the team of 4 heroes you control defeat over 300 monsters, bosses, and ultra bosses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun and fast combat with unique challenges and strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increased speed can be unlocked up to 20x!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OFFLINE rewards are included!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every Limit Break you achieve, unlock another Prestige level.<br> Prestige gives your character more manual click power (damage and healing) and gives you timed premium currency to buy loot boxes and other premium goods. <strong>Become a &quot;Whale&quot; (FOR FREE)!</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character &amp; Class Customization</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very in-depth interface that allows you to see every facet of battle, stats, and more to help you decide how to make your team even stronger!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All classes have unique character art and their own skills, strengths, and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leveling up offers stat points that you can use to build a character ANY way you'd like!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of passive skills that can vastly change abilities and playstyles!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pets &amp; Achievements</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose from 1 of 4 pets to help bolster your team and you control when it uses it's special attack. It's base stats also enhance the party!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ Achievements. Each Achievement you earn, raises the level of your pets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet level is global. If you start a new game, it will inherit that level!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet skill can be used manually. It can also be improved by Passive skills on characters!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Leveling &amp; Progression</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new tier of character power (Level 100, 200, 300, up to 500...) must be unlocked by completing challenging maps with Ultra Bosses!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting &amp; Alchemy &amp; Equipment</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft with 16 different ingredients in 4 different crafting slots. 1,024 different trait combinations per piece of equipment!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique equipment has special stats not found in crafting equipment for even more possibilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alchemy craft that allows you to use potions on your allies and enemies manually! This craft can be improved with a characters skills and gear.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ZERO MTX! We play games, but not with your wallet! We ain't shady like that. One-time buy and complete everything in the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Code: MBX92BP</p>",
        "short_description": "Conquer your free time with this Strategic Idle-RPG that grinds for you! Gathering unique loot, upgrading materials, and XP. Allowing you to jump straight into the fray by crafting equipment, leveling 60+ unique characters, taking on epic boss battles, and challenge an endless tower of difficulty!",
